[h1]EU5 Wordle & Connections[/h1]
[h2]A New Europa Times Mod[/h2]
Were you ever disappointed that you couldn't play your favorite New York Times word games from the comfort of a grand strategy map? Oh... you weren't? Well anyway that's beside the point, because now you can! Just open your game and press the new buttons on the top right panel to access two new minigames, with puzzles that change daily!

[h1]Games:[/h1]
[olist]
 [*][u][b]Wordle:[/b][/u] Get 6 chances to guess a 5-letter word. Each guess gives you feedback to help solve the puzzle:
  [list]
   [*][b]Green:[/b] The letter is in the word and in the [b]correct[/b] spot.
   [*][b]Yellow:[/b] The letter is in the word, but in the [b]wrong[/b] spot.
   [*][b]Gray:[/b] The letter is [b]not[/b] in the secret word at all.
  [/list]
 [*][u][b]Connections:[/b][/u] From grid of 16 words, create four groups of four based on shared themes. But think hard - you can only make 4 mistakes, then it's game over 'til tomorrow! Once a category is solved, its theme will be revealed, color-coded based on its relative difficulty:
  [list]
   [*][b]Yellow:[/b] Most Straightforward and Easiest Group
   [*][b]Green:[/b] Moderate Difficulty
   [*][b]Blue:[/b] Tricky or more specialized knowledge
   [*][b]Purple:[/b] The trickiest group, often involving puns, wordplay, or lateral thinking
  [/list]
[/olist]

[h1]Special Features:[/h1]
[olist]
 [*][b]Daily Updates:[/b] The mod updates itself Daily at 1:00 UTC with the new day's NYT solutions and will reset your game board, so that there's always a new puzzle to solve!
 [*][b]Keyboard Inputs:[/b] Not only can you use the UI buttons to input your Wordle guesses, you can also type them with your keyboard!
 [*][b]Screenshot Mode:[/b] Share with your friends how many tries the Wordle took you, without giving away the answer!
[/olist]

[h1]Compatibility:[/h1]
[list]
 [*]Not Ironman/Achievement Compatible.
 [*]Works in multiplayer! Each player can solve the daily puzzle independently.
 [*]Fully save game compatible.
 [*]Should work with any mod that does not modify the right panel UI.
 [*]If you want to try this with a UI mod, contact sol_invictusxlii on discord for help with making (and publishing) a compatch!
[/list]

[h1]Contributions:[/h1]
